{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS ROGUE RUNNER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Runner is a high-speed running, rogue-like, third-person shooter, action, and parkour game. You must run to break the cycle. As you run, you'll discover different possibilities. Run, Kill, Die, Try new skills, and Repeat to break the cycle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THIEF'S STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alara is a notorious thief who steals dangerous machines. One day, when things go wrong during a heist, she is forced to use the machine she stole. But what she doesn't know is that this machine is a machine of infinite improbability. The machine traps Alara inside its own world of improbability. And the only way out is to break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW YOUR RUN ON MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully procedural generation and different themed maps, you're the only one unaffected by improbability! No matter what map, enemy, trap, or boss you face, you must destroy them all to break the cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCEPT THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the running, listen to the merchants who offer you different abilities or challenges. You can be sure they have cards you'll like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN SKILL SET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no such thing as the right skill set to break the cycle. There is what is right for you. To find it, don't hesitate to try new things during your runs, even if it means dying a few times.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1763313657","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3332790?t=1763313657","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/2ff7d4655a0559c60f19edc3399216fb40372442/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1763313657","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/2ff7d4655a0559c60f19edc3399216fb40372442/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1763313657","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3689050,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/f7b35d53c36cd078adf2684e46065d79.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >WHAT IS ROGUE RUNNER?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Runner is a high-speed running, rogue-like, third-person shooter, action, and parkour game. You must run to break the cycle. As you run, you'll discover different possibilities. Run, Kill, Die, Try new skills, and Repeat to break the cycle!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A THIEF'S STORY</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alara is a notorious thief who steals dangerous machines. One day, when things go wrong during a heist, she is forced to use the machine she stole. But what she doesn't know is that this machine is a machine of infinite improbability. The machine traps Alara inside its own world of improbability. And the only way out is to break the cycle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/b1c5a197b5436a823dcc1e7e8d9529c9.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SHOW YOUR RUN ON MAPS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With fully procedural generation and different themed maps, you're the only one unaffected by improbability! No matter what map, enemy, trap, or boss you face, you must destroy them all to break the cycle.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >ACCEPT THE CARDS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the running, listen to the merchants who offer you different abilities or challenges. You can be sure they have cards you'll like.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.poster.avif?t=1763313657\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.webm?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/extras/2694e1607cfd99cf0b13b03dcfebac96.mp4?t=1763313657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOUR OWN SKILL SET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no such thing as the right skill set to break the cycle. There is what is right for you. To find it, don't hesitate to try new things during your runs, even if it means dying a few times.</p>","developers":["42nd Machine"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3332790/7b0273d24abf5e63010603e0cb824a080242401c/header.jpg?t=1763313657","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1637303628/e977ed55459b38ce6da0be234605428e662f9044/1763306856/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763308132","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1637303628/e977ed55459b38ce6da0be234605428e662f9044/1763306856/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763308132","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3332790/1637303628/e977ed55459b38ce6da0be234605428e662f9044/1763306856/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763308132","id":257232701,"name":"DemoV1Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257232701/015dcd002d9cfcc3e9a26740a287f4d8fa553fd3/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763308132"}],"name":"Rogue Runner","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K / AMD FX - 6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970 or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Amd Ryzen 5 3